# T_SCRE: lending from the open loans: Ins asks for an item ID (digits
# naming no item are searched as text, here finding none), the new loan
# form, a loan added; more
# than is on hand refused at the quantity, the form left without
# saving; Return or release returns a loan on a date typed, refuses a badly typed date
# without asking the server, and refuses a date before the loan went
# out (the server's message).
K INS ENTER
S ASKITEM
T 99999
K ENTER
S NOITEM
K ESC ESC INS ENTER
T 26
K ENTER
S NEWLOAN
K TAB
T Eve Example
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-30
K CTRL-S
S LENT
K INS ENTER
T 11
K ENTER BS
T 2
K TAB
T Fred
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-30
K CTRL-S
S NOTENUF
K ESC
S DISCARDQ
T Y
K ALT-C R
S ASKRET
T 20261007
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ALT-C R
T 2026-1-07
K ENTER
S BADDATE
K END ALT-C R
T 2026-01-01
K ENTER
S BEFORE
K ESC
